  <item>
    <title>28｜Eve：从西安到在冲绳教英语</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69902cfede29766da9909048</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69902cfede29766da9909048</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 14 Feb 2026 08:08:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>这次播客的shownotes：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>从西安到冲绳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">00:02:09</a> 「双减」让人感觉像在沙滩上建房子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">00:03:19</a> 在「吃屎比赛」后，选择新生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">00:04:16</a> 冲绳是小朋友的天堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="608">00:10:08</a> 生活节奏变化，开始思考人生意义</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>How to English?</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="814">00:13:34</a> 学习的根本动力是感到「有用」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1159">00:19:19</a> 捷径是幻觉，馍还得自己咀嚼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1388">00:23:08</a>我们都有「冒充者综合症」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">00:30:31</a> 当学生准备好了，老师自然会出现</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 播客中提到了一本讲有关「练习拒绝」的书，是Jia Jiang 的 </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ehcf80WzmzJWdyWaLqrmaA?scene=1" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ehcf80WzmzJWdyWaLqrmaA?scene=1"><span>Rejection Proof</span></a><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 提到了一个英文单词，regurgitate，表示「反刍」「照本宣科」</span></p><span></span><p><span>👉</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾 Eve 的微信号是 kkmmfamily</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/609fa245530b2e534b38215c/ludZHeM_RS7XjWhglM1muafmqABU.m4a" length="13903515" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnzAOqBKZRiEBHb5cE1LEvIZFzZ2.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>28</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>27｜萌菠菜：逆风前进的单亲两娃妈，幸福的独立英语老师</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66dfc835ee04007d8871c167</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66dfc835ee04007d8871c167</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Sep 2024 04:16:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>👩【聊天的人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾@萌菠菜，她是一位在江西南昌的独立英语老师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>张海露Eric，公众号/微博/小红书/B站账号「张海露Eric」，《方法比知识更重要》作者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕙【Timestamps】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">00:04:05</a>: 从外企工作到负债累累，在闲鱼上找到了第一位学生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">00:06:44</a>: 单亲两娃妈，能力范围内帮助他们打开视野</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1016">00:16:56</a>: 小而美的独立英语教师，幸福来自热爱和信任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">00:23:40</a>: 学英语，最重要的是父母和孩子的心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1829">00:30:29</a>: 能力为先，佛系养娃不代表降低要求</span></p><span></span><h2><span>📖播客中提到的书</span></h2><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jKKJYsVBEQDtnEcbIHs84w" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jKKJYsVBEQDtnEcbIHs84w"><em><span>The Psychology of Money</span></em></a><em><span> </span></em><span>by Morgan Housel</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VQYZqAl37IDxo57BRfRasA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/VQYZqAl37IDxo57BRfRasA"><em><span>Same as Ever</span></em></a><em><span> </span></em><span>by Morgan Housel</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8GLNCJXh4qKup0E0teMJzw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8GLNCJXh4qKup0E0teMJzw"><em><span>Practical Optimism </span></em></a><span>by Sue Varma</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>How to Live </span></em><span>by Derek Sivers</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrkgCQyr84Q5HSc1I0fKuDDxGFsu.m4a" length="60313098" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlXZgCFOco8blvQFMIfo6lT1ZkPZ.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>27</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>26 ｜DL诺尔：5年做了100多期播客，把内容创作当作修行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66c4b48edb5e6d6bf9bb77cc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66c4b48edb5e6d6bf9bb77cc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Aug 2024 15:21:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>👩【聊天的人】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtcW4Hl2mUgXpkHzVwRhfvdgBR1p.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾@DL诺尔，她是英语老师，也是播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e7cb710418a84a04676f05c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e7cb710418a84a04676f05c"><span>「一点不同」</span></a><span>的主理人，她的小红书是「DL诺尔」，公众号是「DL的小世界」</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>张海露Eric，公众号/微博/小红书/B站账号「张海露Eric」，《方法比知识更重要》作者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕙【Timestamps】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">00:02:03</a>: 做播客「一点不同」是收到宇宙和内心的信号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">00:07:10</a>: </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bd2a8d3fba0b73bc40d815" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bd2a8d3fba0b73bc40d815"><span>置顶自己，是女性成长的关键一步</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="863">00:14:23</a>: 做了 100 多期播客是什么体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">00:21:35</a>: Make terrible things</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1726">00:28:46</a>: “内容创作，我至少还要做十年、二十年”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">00:43:10</a>: 做播客，能挣钱吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3023">00:50:23</a>: 兼顾工作和照顾孩子，挤时间的关键是练习“谈判”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3456">00:57:36</a>: 和孩子一起成长，把 good inside 当作咒语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4313">01:11:53</a>: 如何开始做事情？试试每个星期做一件想做但没那么难的事情</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🌟播客中提到的播客</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Blow Your Mind</span></p><span></span><p><span>得意忘形</span></p><span></span><p><span>史蒂夫说</span></p><span></span><p><span>纵横四海</span></p><span></span><h2><span>📖播客中提到的书</span></h2><span></span><p><span>The People Pleaser's Guide to Putting Yourself First by Hollie Azzopardi</span></p><span></span><p><span>Wordslut by Amanda Montell</span></p><span></span><p><span>Someday Is Today Matthew Dicks</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Comfort Book by Matt Haig</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Gifts of Imperfection by Brené Brown</span></p><span></span><p><span>Everything I Never Told You (《无声告白》）by Celeste Ng</span></p><span></span><p><span>Good Inside（《看见孩子》） by Becky Kennedy</span></p><span></span><p><span>Four Thousand Weeks by Oliver Burkeman</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Book You Want Everyone You Love to Read by Philippa Perry（ 提到 guilt 和 resentment 时说的是这本书，原文是 If you have to choose between guilt or resentment, choose guilt.</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👍DL推荐的两个纪录片</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1）《宇宙时空之旅》，Cosmos: A Spacetime Odyssey</span></p><span></span><p><span>2）《简·方达的五幕戏》，Jane Fonda in Five Acts（B站上可以看）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lv9dhwqcIdUz_81Ppe-Zk_TbK7BH.m4a" length="125427540" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:26:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlosUcJoXhhSZ3CqVOCV9W1p3BKH.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>26</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>25｜Moneylover: 30+已婚未育，考了3次雅思，有哪些收获？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6651dc2d4efbc0c3dcfd4fe8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6651dc2d4efbc0c3dcfd4fe8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 May 2024 12:40:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi1e0JwTEoSBK1KyUV8G9ayb1WYL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👩【聊天的人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾@Moneylover。34 岁已婚未育，北京国企工作 8 年，即将赴英读心理咨询硕士。她的公众号是</span><strong><span>「拒绝完美轻写作」</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>张海露Eric，公众号/微博/小红书/B站账号「张海露Eric」，《方法比知识更重要》作者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕙【Timestamps】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">00:02:09</a>:清迈之旅，第一次hiking&amp;camping体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="814">00:13:34</a>:通过3次雅思考试，我更了解自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">00:20:23</a>:第一次考雅思口语只有5.5分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2445">00:40:45</a>:3次成绩一样，心态完全不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2856">00:47:36</a>:讨厌「考试的凝视」，是一种逃避吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3264">00:54:24</a>:正视并利用羡慕嫉妒恨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3672">01:01:12</a>:什么是幸福？求签准不准？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4489">01:14:49</a>:30+已婚未育，选择出国读书的焦虑和压力</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lprXg21ltBVryA0ySdZWHytMYrdz.m4a" length="121382459" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:21:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmvNf4N9Lb_SHxmNCBQIEBALi1C4.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>25</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
