  <item>
    <title>22｜林安：谁痛苦谁改变，恐惧是自由的种子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f17ccd676495707919720d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f17ccd676495707919720d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Mar 2024 10:15:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FginOKrnjdEvb1AK5OiyEyp1Jpor.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>👩【聊天的人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾@林安，自由会客厅发起人，「逆行人生」播客主播。一个不想当老板，间歇性摆烂的品牌主理人。常常立完flag就不见踪影，立志采访完100个不上班的人，至今仍在佛系填坑的内容创作者。</span><br><span>微博/即刻/公众号/小红书/b站/Youtube/知乎：林安的会客厅</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>张海露Eric，公众号「英语学习笔记」作者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌍【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a> 「只工作，不上班」，哪来的自信？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">07:26</a> 其实我并没有别人说的那样「勇敢」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">09:03</a> 谁痛苦谁改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 上班和自由职业，区别不大——It comes with the territory!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> “你必须热爱你的工作“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1864">31:04</a> 多出来走走，发现人人生而斜杠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> “我不敢用小红书，看多了焦虑“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 人各有命，爱折腾是天性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3450">57:30</a> 人要学会告别，割舍才有成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4373">1:12:53</a> 做自己观点的最佳辩手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5120">1:25:20</a> Live unapologetically.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5542">1:32:22</a> 我们的状态松弛如皮筋儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚本期播客提到的书有：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《只工作，不上班》by 林安</span></p><span></span><p><span>《工作DNA》by 郝明义</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>How I Built This</span></em><span> by Guy Raz</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>The Good Enough Job</span></em><span> by Simone Stolzoff</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Think Again</span></em><span> by Adam Grant</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Hidden Potential </span></em><span>by Adam Grant</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Superconmunicators</span></em><span> by Charles Duhigg</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgTbTqmgrSzSSSaanPhIC6jivpns.m4a" length="185055485" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:35:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZobFlWalVxSUQxYVpxT1pfbTVzcENhSmwycTkucG5n.png"/>
