    <guid isPermaLink="false">652534f819dde7bf6a41ed85</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Oct 2023 11:26:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lt_v6kI5EBy9BQXl0qZ8EPIhF01r.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期的嘉宾是 Jing（郑晶），她现在定居比利时，一周两天在餐厅做厨子，两天在学校学 graphic design。之前做过12年出口贸易、医药行业学术峰会。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们主要聊了以下内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">00:02:37</a> 为什么去比利时？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">00:05:27</a> 高考失利，去服装店打工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">00:15:16</a> 英语好，去喜来登工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">00:19:35</a> 应聘外企，学历不够能力来凑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2328">00:38:48</a> 行走江湖的底气是学习能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3490">00:58:10</a> 去比利时当厨子是咋回事？🧑‍🍳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4564">01:16:04</a> 尝试自媒体，拿小红书练习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5578">01:32:58</a> 问Eric：如果你不做自媒体，你会做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5994">01:39:54</a> The Road to Character</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jing 的小红书是「</span><strong><span>正经ZJ</span></strong><span>」，去关注她吧：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuCJ5-zysd9CBeuaNoSXZqOVzhsp.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
