  <item>
    <title>15｜雅君：从法学院到自媒体再到30+留学，勇敢可能是一种“病”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6502c672bbe351e616ee0f81</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6502c672bbe351e616ee0f81</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Sep 2023 08:38:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h4><span>本期的嘉宾是@雅君，她是播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5ef4dcad418a84a0460f70f1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5ef4dcad418a84a0460f70f1"><span>雅君FM</span></a><span>的主理人。</span></h4><span></span><p><span>我们主要聊了以下内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span>性格篇：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">00:02:30</a> ​十年公众号写作之路是如何开始的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">00:05:25</a> 从法学生到媒体人​</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">00:11:40</a> ​勇敢可能是一种“病”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">00:16:00</a> ​人格特质可能取决于生物因素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">00:23:20</a> ​最好的性格是没有性格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">00:27:10</a> ​我的世界只有喜欢的事情和看不见的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">00:32:00</a> ​从数学到生活：哥德尔不完备定律</span></p><span></span><p><span>写作篇：​</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">00:36:10</a> 不读书不写作没关系​</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">00:38:40</a> ​写作是会带来复利的技能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2660">00:44:20</a> 好奇是带着恐惧去行动​</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2800">00:46:40</a> ​自信是结果，不是原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3160">00:52:40</a> ​没有“人设”就不会翻车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">00:55:30</a> ​别给坏情绪提供新的燃料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">00:59:00</a> ​生活中处处是写作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3630">01:00:30</a> ​“你的收入和你带给别人的感动成正比”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3945">01:05:45</a> ​先倾倒再修改，写作过程中允许一切发生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4290">01:11:30</a> ​开始写，自然会逐渐进步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4700">01:18:20</a> ​从自己感到安全的领域开始写作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5130">01:25:30</a> ​分享的边界来自安全感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5610">01:33:30</a> 写作、阅读、学英语的关系​</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5760">01:36:00</a> 女性主义思想启蒙​</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5975">01:39:35</a> 没有什么主义能保证你的幸福​</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6180">01:43:00</a> ​把写作当成宠物，没有预设和期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6430">01:47:10</a> ​写作并不是苦差事，你可以做个快乐轻松的艺术家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6540">01:49:00</a> Jackhammer VS Hummingbird​</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6870">01:54:30</a> ​自由的本质是追寻意外</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7140">01:59:00</a> ​“灵明无着，物来顺应”</span></p><span></span><h4><span>提到的书和其他信息：</span></h4><span></span><p><em><span>Writing Down the Bones</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>大五人格测试</span></p><span></span><p><span>ADHD：注意缺陷与多动障碍（Attention deficit and hyperactivity disorder）</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Think Like a Monk</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Quiet</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Atomic Habits</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>哥德尔不完备定律</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Thinking Better</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>《25岁，如何规划你的人生》</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Excellent Advice for Living</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Show Your Work</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>韩剧：机智的医生生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>《厌女》</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Eat, Pray, Love</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Big Magic</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>《脆弱的力量》</span></p><span></span><p><span>短片：苍蝇的一生</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq5zpIJ54XWaedYRM0PqR_Cui9NE.m4a" length="177209084" type="audio/mp4"/>
